---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { company } from '../data/site';
---

<Legal title="Refund Policy" description="How cancellations and refunds work for VigilOps paid plans.">
  <h2>Cancelling</h2>
  <p>
    You can cancel a Pro or Team plan at any time. Cancelling stops future renewals; your plan stays active until the end of
    the monthly or yearly period you have already paid for.
  </p>

  <h2>Refunds</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>First purchase:</strong> if you're not happy, email us within 14 days of your first payment and we'll refund it in
      full.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Yearly plans:</strong> if you cancel after the first 14 days, we don't refund the remaining months, but your plan
      stays active until the end of the year.
    </li>
    <li><strong>Renewals:</strong> renewal payments are not refunded, except where the law requires it.</li>
    <li><strong>Duplicate or mistaken charges</strong> are always refunded.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How to ask</h2>
  <p>
    Email <a href={`mailto:${company.supportEmail}`}>{company.supportEmail}</a> from the address you subscribed with. Approved
    refunds go back to the original payment method through our payment provider Bachs; how long they take to appear depends
    on your bank or card issuer.
  </p>
</Legal>
